# UI Styling & Design System

## UI Library Stack
- **Primary**: MUI (Material-UI) - Main component library with SX-based styling
- **Styling**: MUI SX prop for all custom styling needs
- **No mixing** of other UI libraries or styling approaches (no Tailwind,
  no shadcn/Radix — those were removed from `package.json`)

## MUI Design System

### MUI Component Usage
```javascript
// ✅ Correct - Use MUI components directly
import {
  Card,
  CardContent,
  Typography,
  Box,
  Avatar
} from '@mui/material'

const RoomMemberCard = ({ member, isDj }) => {
  return (
    <Card sx={{ maxWidth: 345 }}>
      <CardContent sx={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 1.5 }}>
        <Avatar src={member.avatarUrl} alt={member.displayName} />
        <Typography variant="h6" component="h2">
          {member.displayName}
        </Typography>
        {isDj && (
          <Typography variant="body2" color="text.secondary">
            DJ
          </Typography>
        )}
      </CardContent>
    </Card>
  )
}
```

